WEBVTT

00:07:57.392 --> 00:08:00.366
Ahhhh, very good.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.108
Now we're going to warm up our lips,

00:08:02.132 --> 00:08:04.460
and we're going to go Ba, Ba, Ba, Ba,

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:07.412
Ba, Ba, Ba, Ba. Very good.

00:08:07.436 --> 00:08:10.852
And now, brrrrrrrrrr,

00:08:10.876 --> 00:08:12.402
just like when you were a kid.

00:08:12.426 --> 00:08:14.829
Brrrr. Now your lips
should be coming alive.

00:08:14.853 --> 00:08:16.504
We're going to do the tongue next

00:08:16.528 --> 00:08:20.826
with exaggerated la, la, la,
la, la, la, la, la, la.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.041
Beautiful. You're getting
really good at this.

00:08:23.065 --> 00:08:25.931
And then, roll an R. Rrrrrrr.

00:08:25.955 --> 00:08:28.147
That's like champagne for the tongue.

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:30.467
Finally, and if I can only do one,